{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Character｜初始化流程图\nGate80已验证同GI注册、原Extension/Hero GameplayReady与原CMC accepted配置；首W／Run／网络未验。\nASC／Health节点保留上次检查点正文，专项另核；InitState不授ASC Ready。\n[[GGYGO_结构_角色与组件.canvas|结构图]] · [[Character/结构|结构文档]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1650,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "spawn",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. GameMode / BossEncounter 生成 Pawn，装入 PawnData。\n\n玩家：GameMode::SpawnSquadMember/SpawnSquadSlot；Boss：BossEncounter::SpawnBoss；对 PawnExtension::SetPawnData(Data)。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "owner",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. Slot 或 BossState 先拥有 ASC、基础属性与 Authority 授予的能力。\n\nAuthority 初始化安装 ASC 规则并调用 AbilitySet；客户端在 PawnData / BossDefinition OnRep 后只幂等安装 AbilityGroupConfig 与 TagRelationshipMapping。",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "bind",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. 已写入的绑定链（未编译）\nHost Attach／OnRep或Extension Initialize→RequestAvatarBinding(原端点/Context,空H)。\nASC实际Init commit→Install→Host公布→真实Publish/Dispatching→NotifyLocalResourcesReady。\nExtension Getter／回放只认原H真实Ready，旧缓存已删除。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "init",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4. Extension｜唯一配置分发\nSetPawnData／Controller／feature通知→CheckDefaultInitialization；先推进其他feature。\n原Manager查询：\n`HaveAllFeaturesReachedInitState`\n`(Pawn,DataAvailable)`\n所有feature≥DataAvailable→DataInitialized→`ApplyPawnDataToConsumers`→原CMC `SetMovementSet(PawnData->MovementSet)`。\n各feature独立推进；本链与ASC绑定、Base／Health订阅独立，不发布ASC Ready。\n[[Character/结构#InitState 注册与 PawnData 分发（Gate80 有限验收）|守卫与验收]]",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 玩家分支｜Hero原生输入装配\nBeginPlay／CharacterBase::SetupPlayerInputComponent→InitializePlayerInput；输入与相机委托沿既有入口。\nHero只等待Extension≥DataAvailable，可先到GameplayReady；Setup可独立建立输入会话。\nM3接线已编译：原Started／OwnerSync Ready→查原Source仍Held→`TryAdmitInitialMovementInputRequest`。\n原Session／Binding／Observer精确清理；实际首W／Run未验。\n[[Movement/结构|输入准入与执行]]",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 878,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "boss",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Boss 分支：AIController 驱动 BT，Pawn 不需要玩家 Hero 输入组件。\n\n调用：BossAIController 驱动 BehaviorTree；BTTask 通过 BossState::GetGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent 访问 ASC。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 918,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "pyrios-visual",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "玩家视觉支路：`AGGYGOHeroCharacter` 的 `StylizedRenderComponent::BeginPlay` 读取已就绪的 Mesh，调用 `RefreshMaterials()` 建立 MID 与描边。\n不等待 ASC / InitState；非 Pyrois Mesh 无匹配时保持原材质。\n[[GGYGO_流程_Pyrios渲染.canvas|展开材质、主光与描边链路]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 265,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "unbind",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Host已写入的退出链（未编译）\nDetach／销毁／EndPlay→原H/Context Request(Release)。\nWithdraw→原Cancel/Input/Cue→ASC Clear→退Host原资源/订阅→真实发布Released。\n旧栈失效停止；Destroy准入和未commit清理共享停点开放，原R0未复测。",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 986,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "death-projection",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "死亡投影：StartDeath → Dying；FinishDeath → Dying + Dead。\n\n标签保存在持久 ASC；解绑不清除，NotDead 不隐式复活。Authority 死亡宿主拒绝接入不同的新 Avatar。",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 1245,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "local-asc-phases",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原请求／真实发布链（Host源码已写，消费者未全接）\nRequestAvatarBinding携原端点/H/Context→真实Steps；结果不授第二Ready。\nInstallLocalAbilitySystemResources(ASC,Pawn,CommittedContext)只建Installed H。\nHost公布原H/Context/Avatar→ASC Publish验Installed→原Receipt实际Dispatching→NotifyLocalResourcesReady(H,Receipt)。\nRelease：Withdraw(H)→原Context Cancel→无回调全输入退休→Cue保旧Avatar路由→ASC Clear→退Host原H/销毁订阅→真实发布NotifyReleased(H)。\n每次外调后重检原范围，旧栈不收养后继；Ready/Released普通回调可立即完整接续，原生Busy不排队。\nExtension Getter/注册/EndPlay已切换；EndPlay关闭后的Released只退休原义务、不广播，消费者须自身精确清理。Health原资源已实现；Base typed消费已源码接入、Hero待接，CMC E1保持。新代码未编译/UE，原R0最近仍失败，两共享ASC清理停点留账。\n[[Character/结构#ASC 本地资源四阶段接口（L1）|本地合同]] · [[Combatants/结构|Host实现/停点]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|ASC]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1560,
      "width": 1890,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "health-original-resource-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2030,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 760,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Base→Health原资源链｜已编码、未编译\nBase PostInitializeComponents Super后先装原订阅，再RegisterAndCall；同步回放先退休时，晚token精确还原Extension。\nBase Consume复制原订阅/整Notice：Ready带明确Extension/H/PublishedContext→`InitializeWithLocalAbilitySystemResource`验证原Pawn、真实Ready、实际HealthSet。\n唯一原记录安装五token→原DeathState投影→三次UI初值；每外调复核原记录与Context，失效停止并仅清本次原记录，不清合法后继。\nBase Refreshed同H→`RefreshLocalAbilitySystemResource`认证新Context，不重装token或重复UI；事件lambda每入口复制当前认证Context。\nBase Released仅通知原H→`UninitializeFromLocalAbilitySystemResource`：匹配原记录→先退休/摘自身槽→五精确Remove，不RequireReady。\nEndPlay/OnUnregister先关闭自身准入，独立退休原资源，不依赖Extension广播。\nBase EndPlay/BeginDestroy先闭准入退原通知token，Health独立退五token；普通消费尾部仅诊断不清后继，真实新BeginPlay才重开。\n旧BP wrapper保留签名共用真实原H机制；Base不再调用旧BP/无参数回调。\n未新编译/UE；旧无H夹具历史成功不适用。\n[[Character/结构#Health原资源与五委托（已编码，未编译）|完整接口与停止点]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "system-initstate-order",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## System｜同GI原生启动前置\nUGameInstance::Init→SubsystemCollection.Initialize→UGGYGOInitStateRegistrationSubsystem::Initialize。\n`InitializeDependency<UGameFrameworkComponentManager>()`取得同一原GI的Manager；RegisterInitState按四阶段锚点登记。\n相邻正向true／逆向false全通过后才输出RegisteredOrder；顺序与feature状态唯一归原Manager，已有逆序明确失败。\nReceiveInit早于本前置；本地StateChain／feature注册不登记全局顺序。\n[[System/结构|System注册契约]]",
      "x": 2030,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 335,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
